  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d966c54451c3c66180b0f0bba2c151e, type: 3}
  m_Name: HRMemo
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SubjectZero.Story.TextDocumentData
  documentTitle: 'To All Staff :'
  bodyText: "Following review, Ventrell campus operations will be paused effective
    November 1, 2005 pending relocation of active research to our Denver facility.
    Please clear personal effects from workstations by end of month. Questions to
    HR.\n\nRelocation details: Active projects in Sectors A\u2013C will transition
    to Denver over a phased 6-week schedule. Staff will be contacted individually
    regarding transfer eligibility and severance options where applicable.\n\nSector
    D projects are not part of the relocation. Sector D staff should direct questions
    to Dr. Anselm directly, not HR \u2014 we do not have visibility into that program's
    transition plan.\n\nPlease note: campus badge access will be deactivated in stages
    as sectors close. If your badge stops working before your scheduled clear-out
    date, do not attempt to re-enter \u2014 contact facilities for an escort.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nA
    reminder that all research materials, notebooks, and recordings remain Ventrell
    property and may not be removed from the premises, including personal notes taken
    during work hours. Exit interviews will include a materials checklist.\n\nWe
    recognize this transition has been difficult for many of you, especially given
    recent events in Sector D. Counseling resources remain available through the
    employee assistance line through the end of the month, after which the line will
    be discontinued along with other campus services."
